&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with teams and technical projects distributed across the globe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running projects that include machine learning and large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience articulating business questions and using available data to find answers that translate into business recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
